# Redirect rules for MDK Gallery on Netlify

# Clean URL 301 Redirects to canonical .html pages for Google Search Console indexability
/index          /index.html     301
/about          /about.html     301
/services       /services.html  301
/projects       /projects.html  301
/contact        /contact.html   301

# Root redirect guarantee
/               /index.html     200

# Canonical domain redirects for Netlify temporary domains
https://works-mdk.netlify.app/*    https://workmdk.netlify.app/:splat  301!
https://works.mdk.netfily.app/*    https://workmdk.netlify.app/:splat  301!
